     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"'><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416230311.png" target=_blank> </A><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416215366.png" target=_blank> </A><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416204389.png" target=_blank> </A>全体高一同学：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"'><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"'>为帮助同学们进行科学有效的自我评估，明晰个人的兴趣、特质、优势潜能，为高中的选科学习及未来的大学专业，乃至生涯规划提供参考依据，学校引进了专业的生涯规划测评服务，这是一个专为高中生开发的生涯测评工具。学校希望借助该平台的测评与信息系统，让每个人都能有更清晰的自我认知，更明确地开始生涯规划，为美好的未来早做准备。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%'>一、重要事项说明<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">1.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%'>本次测评平台所有项目学生个人无须付任何费用！<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">2.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%'>请预留<SPAN lang=EN-US>40</SPAN>分钟的不受干扰的连续时间段用于测试。为保证测评的准确性，务必依照个人情况，真实作答，独立完成。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">3.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%'>测验结果仅供参考，测评结果并非绝对化，也不代表学校意见，请理性看待，把测评结果作为自己思考及决策的参考之一，并综合其他因素，以对自己认真负责的态度自由思考及决策。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">4.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%'>测评过程中如有技术问题请参照末页常见问题解答，或拨打客服电话。测评后如对报告有疑问或有其他生涯困惑的，可与你的生涯规划老师联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%'>二、操作指南<SPAN lang=EN-US>:<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">5.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'>请在<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">电脑</B>上使用<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">非<SPAN lang=EN-US>IE</SPAN></B>浏览器（<SPAN style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow">最好是<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>Chrome</SPAN></B>或者<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>Firefox</SPAN></B></SPAN>）打开，或在<SPAN lang=EN-US>iPad</SPAN>上用<SPAN lang=EN-US>Safari</SPAN>打开。网址：<SPAN lang=EN-US>https://wenxiangcn.com/<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">6.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'>选择右上角“登录”输入账号、密码登录平台。请注意填写正确信息。账号为自己的身份证号，密码为自己的学号（<SPAN lang=EN-US>190601010XXX</SPAN>）。如账号有问题可与班主任联系了解自己的登录账号。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"><?xml:namespace prefix = "v" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 stroked="f" filled="f" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" o:preferrelative="t" o:spt="75" coordsize="21600,21600"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:connecttype="rect" gradientshapeok="t" o:extrusionok="f"></v:path><o:lock aspectratio="t" v:ext="edit"></o:lock></v:shapetype></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416184082.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416184082.png" width=1440 height=673> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">7.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'>为了保证测评结果的准确性，请如实答题。<SPAN style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow">特别提醒：这不是考试，题目没有标准答案，请按照自身情况选择</SPAN>，且一旦作答无法返回修改，规定时间内未作答的题目会自动跳过。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">8.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'>点击马上测评进行测评。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-no-proof: yes"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416195628.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020051416195628.png" width=1440 height=673> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">9.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>     </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'>测评题目包含兴趣、专业胜任力、自我认知<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>部分。如在完成测评之前，<SPAN style="COLOR: red">切勿</SPAN>点击答题弹框上的关闭按钮，会导致所有已经作答的信息将会被全部清空，再次登录时需重新作答。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑'><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">10.<SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'>  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%'>如在测试时直接关闭浏览器，已经作答的题目不会被清空，再次登录将会从之前断开的地方继续答题。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
